        "identifier": "https://github.com/carlok/diaz-modulus-lean",
        "note": "The canonical home of this proof, by the same author, and of a wider library on Diaz's conjecture. The theorem has been there as Diaz.six_exponentials since 2026-09-13. This repository copies its import closure (eleven modules, 1,147 lines, at commit edb9c5b92df0935ed6834e1d965fe9c18cfa21bb) with only the changes the Lean module system needs and with the namespaces renamed, so that the theorem can be checked on its own. The proofs are the same; corrections are made there first. The library also proves results not included here.",
