        "identifier": "https://github.com/telaviv/strong-six-exponentials",
        "note": "An independent Lean development by another author, public since 2026-10-18, after the proof here. As its name says, it concerns the strong six exponentials theorem, a strengthening of the theorem here. Cited as related work only: nothing in this repository was taken from it, and its code was not consulted.",
